WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.045
A corporate event works
when everyone knows

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.580
what needs to happen next.

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:07.765
Our team brings years
of production experience

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.000
to your conference, launch,
or client event.

00:00:11.619 --> 00:00:13.640
We coordinate the venue and vendors,

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.520
set the cues for sound
and presentations,

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.600
and manage hospitality
and staffing on the day.

00:00:21.301 --> 00:00:25.180
Our event platform gives the crew
one place for the schedule,

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.240
updates, and assignments.

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.400
The platform can also handle
guest registration and check-in.

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.630
Tell us what you want to accomplish.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.210
Let’s build the production around it.
